Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.03,0:01:05.04,Kimi-Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fnCrayonAL\fs120\b1\blur4\c&H605E85&\pos(968,778)}determination
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.54,0:01:08.00,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,What... should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.50,0:01:09.54,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Sawako!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.54,0:01:10.63,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,Sawako!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.63,0:01:11.80,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,Sawako!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.42,0:01:16.09,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,What's gotten into you? You keep dropping your rice!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.59,0:01:18.68,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Is everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.68,0:01:20.51,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I-It's nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.51,0:01:22.97,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I was just thinking about the upcoming tests.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.97,0:01:26.19,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Oh, so they start tomorrow, huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.19,0:01:27.10,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.10,0:01:28.85,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Thanks for the meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.85,0:01:30.73,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,That's all you're going to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.98,0:01:31.90,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.48,0:01:38.61,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,When I see Yano-san, Yoshida-san, and Kazehaya-kun tomorrow...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.61,0:01:41.83,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,...what am I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.79,0:01:48.54,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Oh... right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.54,0:01:52.71,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Since we have a test today, we're going to\N be seated according to our student numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.17,0:01:56.01,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I wonder who's sitting in my usual seat...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.88,0:01:58.47,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Yano-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.72,0:02:01.10,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,She's actually sitting there without complaints!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.60,0:02:04.39,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Even though people are spreading\N weird rumors about her because of me...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.73,0:02:15.23,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Yano-san, Yoshida-san, and Kazehaya-kun have\N never appeared to be disgusted or frightened of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.94,0:02:20.45,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,They've... always been so nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.41,0:02:26.41,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.54,0:02:30.96,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, your testing seat is Sadako's seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.96,0:02:32.29,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.29,0:02:33.29,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Sadako...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.92,0:02:39.76,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,Even if it always ended up with her killing the mood, she's always greeted everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.76,0:02:44.47,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,But today, she just sat down in her seat\N without looking at anyone... not even me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.47,0:02:45.47,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.77,0:02:47.48,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,I don't know, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.39,0:02:49.48,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,All we know is...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.73,0:02:51.90,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,...she's not acting like her regular self.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.94,0:03:00.24,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Now that I'm so far away from where I usually\N sit, it feels like I never sat there in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.24,0:03:04.66,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,It feels like I'd never been there at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.24,0:03:08.62,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,The memories feel so distant, almost like it was a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.62,0:03:11.08,Kimi-Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\fnLC Chalk\fs125\frz330\frx350\fry325\c&H7D6A56&\pos(1020,415)}Math
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.62,0:03:11.08,Kimi-Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\fnLC Chalk\fs100\frz330\frx350\fry325\fscx90\c&H8B7565&\pos(891,794)}Eng{\fax0.1}lish
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.16,0:03:11.08,Default,Teach,0,0,0,,You may begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.75,0:03:16.30,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I didn't want to cause trouble. I wanted to be useful to everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.17,0:03:22.55,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,But... I still haven't been able to clear up the\N misunderstanding between Yano-san, Yoshida-san and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.76,0:03:29.77,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Even if I find the people who are spreading\N the rumors and correct the misunderstanding,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.77,0:03:34.73,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,as long as I am around them, I'll end up hurting them again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.36,0:03:37.02,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Hurting such kind people...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.28,0:03:47.28,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I may be able to clear up the misunderstanding, but I still\N don't know how I could possibly heal their wounded hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.16,0:03:53.58,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,So... I'm going to pretend like nothing ever\N happened and distance myself from everyone again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.38,0:03:57.04,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I'm sure that's the best thing to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.88,0:04:01.63,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I wonder if Yoshida-san ended up using my notes?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.43,0:04:05.30,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,If she did, I hope they were helpful...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.43,0:04:11.27,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Yano-san, I memorized a ghost story.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.81,0:04:14.35,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I wanted you to be the first one to hear it, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.52,0:04:17.06,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,...I guess that's not possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.53,0:04:22.57,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Kazehaya-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.20,0:04:25.45,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.08,0:04:32.96,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.83,0:04:35.75,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I was so happy...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.54,0:04:38.84,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,It's what I've always longed for...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.84,0:04:40.63,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,It's what I've always dreamed of...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.63,0:04:41.92,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I've always...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.38,0:04:47.18,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I don't even know how I was able to get by on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.68,0:04:51.02,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Now that I know...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.02,0:04:54.85,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,...how it feels to be treated kindly, and the feeling of wanting to return the kindness...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.48,0:04:58.86,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I don't know how I could possibly go back to being alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.77,0:05:04.40,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,How was I able to be alone? How was I able to go on?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.78,0:05:10.41,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I've... I've forgotten everything...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.58,0:05:13.54,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Everything...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.98,0:05:42.02,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,You were waiting for me at this very\N place on the first day of summer vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.48,0:05:44.57,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,I'm still not convinced.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.24,0:05:47.95,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,If you don't hate me, then why are you avoiding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.91,0:05:56.37,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Please... don't talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.54,0:05:59.50,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.50,0:06:02.13,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I just can't bring myself to say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.42,0:06:07.17,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I... I've tried, but I still can't say something I really don't mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.17,0:06:08.55,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Wait, what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.55,0:06:11.39,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I'm sorry if I'm making you lose your popularity!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.51,0:06:11.97,Default-alt,Kaze,0,0,0,,Hey, wait-
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.97,0:06:12.93,Default-alt,Kaze,0,0,0,,Kuronuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.76,0:06:16.31,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,You have to speak clearly or I can't understand you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.31,0:06:22.69,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,P-People said that if I'm around you, I'll make you to lose your popularity!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.69,0:06:23.32,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Popularity?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.57,0:06:24.65,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Who told you that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.65,0:06:26.32,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,People were spreading rumors about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.32,0:06:27.03,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Rumors?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.11,0:06:29.53,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Popularity... Rumors...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.74,0:06:33.24,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Where does my decision fit into that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.24,0:06:36.83,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,That's not something for you to decide!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.12,0:06:39.87,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,It's something for {\i1}me{\i0\fscx30} {\r} to decide!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.79,0:06:45.84,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,I'm... going to do things the way I want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.01,0:06:49.01,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,If I want to speak to you, then I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.47,0:06:52.60,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,If I didn't want to, then I wouldn't be doing this right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.56,0:06:58.27,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,I don't care what rumors are going around.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.89,0:07:04.61,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,The only Kuronuma I know is the one I see with my own eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.82,0:07:10.07,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I've... always been longing for people like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.82,0:07:15.70,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,People like Yano-san, Yoshida-san, and Kazehaya-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.79,0:07:19.75,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I've always dreamed...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.62,0:07:26.46,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,...that one day, I'd be able to think of someone as\N precious, and they would feel the same about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.38,0:07:33.51,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Have you calmed down a bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.80,0:07:37.77,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Th-Thank you...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.77,0:07:39.68,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I was really thirsty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.27,0:07:43.65,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.19,0:07:51.45,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Then I guess I'll keep this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.15,0:07:56.66,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Until just a few moments ago, I was in complete despair.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.20,0:07:58.24,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,And yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.04,0:08:03.54,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,...somehow, I feel myself cheering up\N as I look up to see Kazehaya-kun smiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.38,0:08:07.29,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,It's like my heart is opening up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.30,0:08:12.59,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,The only Kuronuma I know is the one I see with my own eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.30,0:08:14.55,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Those words made me so happy...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.26,0:08:18.06,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I interpreted that as, "You can stay by my side."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.10,0:08:20.27,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,It made me so happy...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.64,0:08:23.10,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Oh, I get it...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.10,0:08:26.48,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,So the reason things are kind of rough between\N the three of you was because of rumors, too, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.69,0:08:30.65,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,How would you have felt if things were the other way around?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.65,0:08:31.69,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.69,0:08:39.66,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,What if Yano, Yoshida and I had started to distance\N ourselves from you, thinking that we'd only make you less popular?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.83,0:08:43.12,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I'd hate that!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.00,0:08:46.42,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I want to be with everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.25,0:08:51.76,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Maybe they feel the same way, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.80,0:08:56.34,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,In the end, it all comes down to how the other person feels.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.30,0:08:59.60,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,I don't know how exactly those two feel, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.01,0:09:03.52,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,...I'm sure they'll start to worry if you avoid them suddenly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.56,0:09:07.69,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,At least, I know {\i1}I{\i0\fscx30} {\r} was worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.69,0:09:10.11,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I-I-I-I-I-I'm s-so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.11,0:09:10.82,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Never.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.98,0:09:13.69,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,And I mean never.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.69,0:09:15.57,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Never are you allowed to avoid me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.87,0:09:24.12,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I wonder if anyone in my life has told me I wasn't allowed to\N avoid them, rather than say I wasn't allowed to come near them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.12,0:09:31.92,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I guess I was thinking too logically.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.46,0:09:34.42,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,But still... I have to ask them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.84,0:09:38.01,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,No, my feelings won't get through unless I tell them directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.47,0:09:43.06,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I want to tell Yano-san and Yoshida-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.89,0:09:47.64,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I really want them to hear my feelings, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.48,0:09:51.52,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Don't forget, you already have someone you can talk to, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.07,0:09:58.57,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I'm going to try talking to them tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.11,0:10:04.91,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I-I don't just want to be their classmate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.91,0:10:08.08,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I want to become their f-friend...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.08,0:10:09.12,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.12,0:10:12.59,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I-I'm going to try my best to become friends with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.42,0:10:15.46,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I said it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.01,0:10:16.88,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.01,0:10:21.97,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Go for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.56,0:10:28.48,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.65,0:10:35.40,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,And just with those words and his smile alone, he gives me the push I need to move forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.41,0:10:43.87,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,You can do it, Kuronuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.54,0:10:46.54,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,I know you'll be able to.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.00,0:10:49.00,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Stay strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.54,0:10:54.88,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I can do it, Kazehaya-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.92,0:10:58.42,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I'll definitely do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.64,0:11:09.14,Default,Pin,0,0,0,,What the hell are you still doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.14,0:11:11.65,Default,Pin,0,0,0,,Why don't you go home and study or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.65,0:11:14.44,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,I'm on my way to the library to do just that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.44,0:11:15.48,Default,Pin,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.48,0:11:17.57,Default,Pin,0,0,0,,You're more serious than you look.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.19,0:11:21.57,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,You know, it was your fault to begin with!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.57,0:11:22.78,Default,Pin,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.78,0:11:25.66,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,If you hadn't shown up back then...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.66,0:11:27.95,Default,Pin,0,0,0,,What in the world are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.95,0:11:29.87,Default,Pin,0,0,0,,If I hadn't shown up, then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.87,0:11:33.50,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,If you hadn't shown up...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.50,0:11:36.42,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,...I would have been able to eavesdrop on Sadako?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.75,0:11:37.84,Default,Pin,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.84,0:11:39.05,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.17,0:11:42.76,Default,Pin,0,0,0,,Hey! Don't be blaming others.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.30,0:11:48.52,Default,Pin,0,0,0,,I don't know what you're talking about, but\N blaming things on others doesn't solve anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.77,0:11:52.23,Default,Pin,0,0,0,,You're going to come across a lot of unfairness in the course of your life,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.69,0:11:57.19,Default,Pin,0,0,0,,but you're just going to have to deal with it yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.19,0:12:00.11,Default,Pin,0,0,0,,Even if I'm the reason for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.28,0:12:03.95,Default,Pin,0,0,0,,Deal with it yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.32,0:12:08.66,Default,Pin,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, you gave the workout plan to Ryu, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.66,0:12:11.54,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,I threw it in a fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.54,0:12:13.17,Default,Pin,0,0,0,,What did you say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.25,0:12:16.04,Default,Pin,0,0,0,,Don't be blaming others.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.17,0:12:18.34,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,What's his problem?
