Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.44,0:12:43.07,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,She checked out this one, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.53,0:12:46.20,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,Why are they all Japanese ghost stories?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.07,0:12:48.66,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,She's such a strange girl...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.95,0:12:52.66,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,Why don't you just try to make the best of that appearance then?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.04,0:12:57.88,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,It was only an off-hand remark, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.80,0:13:01.38,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,She's so damn serious...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.01,0:13:08.64,Default,Ryu,0,0,0,,Hey, you look depressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.39,0:13:13.85,Default,Ryu,0,0,0,,Want me to cheer you up?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.77,0:13:16.85,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,No, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.85,0:13:18.15,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,I'm not depressed!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.52,0:13:24.78,Default,Ryu,0,0,0,,{\fscx99}Ever since we were kids, you'd always be sitting by your doorstep whenever you got kicked out of the house for doing something bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.45,0:13:26.82,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.82,0:13:28.70,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Were you jogging or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.70,0:13:29.41,Default,Ryu,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.41,0:13:31.54,Default,Ryu,0,0,0,,It's a part of Pin's secret training menu.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.45,0:13:36.12,Default,Ryu,0,0,0,,You're not feeling down because of those\N rumors about you being a delinquent, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.37,0:13:38.83,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Those rumors don't bother me at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.83,0:13:39.75,Default,Ryu,0,0,0,,Thought so.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.55,0:13:44.63,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,I'm stupid, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.88,0:13:47.76,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,I don't get what's going on at all!!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.76,0:13:50.72,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Is Sadako really Sadako?! Or does\N she have an alternate personality?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.72,0:13:52.60,Default,Ryu,0,0,0,,You really don't get it, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.89,0:13:54.89,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,So in other words...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.27,0:13:58.56,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,When I asked who started the\N rumors, they said it all came from Sadako...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.10,0:14:02.23,Default,Ryu,0,0,0,,How would she spread the rumors? By talking to herself?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.48,0:14:07.82,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,If she did that, the rumors would be about her muttering to herself!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.82,0:14:10.74,Default,Ryu,0,0,0,,Well, I mean, she doesn't seem like she has people to talk to.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.87,0:14:13.33,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Y-You're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.33,0:14:14.41,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.41,0:14:16.16,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Wow, you're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.16,0:14:17.04,Default,Ryu,0,0,0,,Simpleton.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.50,0:14:22.17,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Now that I think about it, she was\N talking to someone I didn't know...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.59,0:14:26.30,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,And on top of that, she was saying\N something about us not being her friends...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.30,0:14:29.72,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,And to put a cherry on top, she doesn't seem to like us...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.72,0:14:31.80,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,I think she's avoiding us, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.01,0:14:33.85,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Geez...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.47,0:14:36.98,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,What did you mean by "Sorry", Sadako?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.98,0:14:40.31,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Why didn't you tell us you liked us when I asked you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.56,0:14:42.94,Default,Ryu,0,0,0,,Well, I guess she doesn't like you then.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.61,0:14:46.90,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Then what is it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.90,0:14:48.28,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,She hates us?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.28,0:14:49.70,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,She was using us?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.70,0:14:50.74,Default,Ryu,0,0,0,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.74,0:14:53.28,Default,Ryu,0,0,0,,And there's also a possibility that she just doesn't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.49,0:14:58.41,Default,Ryu,0,0,0,,And there could be other reasons, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.91,0:14:59.96,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Other reasons?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.96,0:15:01.33,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,What else could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.33,0:15:02.67,Default,Ryu,0,0,0,,Hell if I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.67,0:15:04.96,Default,Ryu,0,0,0,,Why don't you ask her directly if it's bugging you so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.30,0:15:09.13,Default,Ryu,0,0,0,,I'll cheer you up if she says that she doesn't care about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.38,0:15:10.09,Default,Ryu,0,0,0,,Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.09,0:15:11.64,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,I don't need you to cheer me up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.06,0:15:26.44,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,What did he mean by "other reasons"?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.65,0:15:30.53,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Her notes were so easy to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.49,0:15:34.57,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,She did make them with my academic capabilities in mind, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.99,0:15:37.74,Kimi-Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.75\alpha&H66&\fnEager Naturalist\fs75\c&H6E7174&\fax0.3\frx26\fry4\frz32\pos(364,118)}Yoshida-san
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.99,0:15:36.12,Kimi-Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.75\alpha&H55&\fnEager Naturalist\fs75\c&H6E7174&\fax0.3\frx26\fry4\frz38.048\pos(614,370)\clip(m 608 398 l 634 441 501 556 447 499)}You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.12,0:15:36.20,Kimi-Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.75\alpha&H55&\fnEager Naturalist\fs75\c&H6E7174&\fax0.3\frx26\fry4\frz38.048\pos(614,370)\clip(m 654 359 l 686 409 502 548 453 500)}You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.20,0:15:36.28,Kimi-Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.75\alpha&H55&\fnEager Naturalist\fs75\c&H6E7174&\fax0.3\frx26\fry4\frz38.048\pos(614,370)\clip(m 690 316 l 740 379 503 551 451 499)}You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.28,0:15:37.74,Kimi-Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.75\alpha&H55&\fnEager Naturalist\fs75\c&H6E7174&\fax0.3\frx26\fry4\frz38.048\pos(614,370)}You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.75,0:15:43.13,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Sadako totally sucks at drawing!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.67,0:15:54.22,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,She went through all this trouble... just for me...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.68,0:15:56.10,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Who in their right mind would do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.02,0:16:02.23,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,Chizu?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.23,0:16:04.65,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,Could you come out for a bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.15,0:16:09.15,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,How did you do on your test?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.15,0:16:11.11,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Well... yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.11,0:16:13.70,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,I understood all the parts that Sadako went over with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.70,0:16:14.66,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.99,0:16:20.62,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,I haven't seen Sadako smile once,\N since all this stuff started happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.62,0:16:25.08,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,She seemed really happy before all this, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.58,0:16:29.80,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,You saw her smile when she was\N helping us all prepare for the test, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.80,0:16:31.01,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,I sure did!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.01,0:16:32.84,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,That was a shocker!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.47,0:16:40.85,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.85,0:16:42.02,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.35,0:16:47.23,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Don't you think she's gotten used to people\N avoiding her and it sort of became a regular thing for her?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.23,0:16:50.78,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Isn't that kind of sad?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.32,0:16:52.74,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,She's such a nice girl, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.57,0:16:56.49,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,That's why I couldn't leave her be.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.07,0:16:59.08,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,Yeah... maybe that was it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.33,0:17:01.79,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,She had already gotten used to the way everyone was treating her,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.79,0:17:06.58,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,and she turned into someone who has trouble\N understanding how others feel and her own emotions, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.00,0:17:10.34,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,I started to notice that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.34,0:17:16.59,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,That's why it made me really happy\N to see such a natural smile on her face.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.14,0:17:20.14,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,You were thinking about something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.14,0:17:23.31,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,Stop crying. You're embarrassing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.48,0:17:28.52,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,I didn't know you cared so much about Sadako, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.36,0:17:31.11,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.65,0:17:38.45,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,I really felt like I understood Sadako, but it turns out\N I didn't, which made me unsure about so many things.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.24,0:17:42.99,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,But there are a lot of things we don't know about each other, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.62,0:17:50.46,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Yano-chin, we haven't told Sadako\N the most important thing yet, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.88,0:17:56.47,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Sadako doesn't know how much we care about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.68,0:18:01.18,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,We still haven't figured out what she meant by "sorry", yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.10,0:18:04.10,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,What she meant when she said we weren't her friends...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.23,0:18:07.35,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,And what she still had to say back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.11,0:18:14.44,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,If we'd stuck around to listen, I wonder what she would've said.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.40,0:18:21.07,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,In the beginning, I was positive she was one\N of those types that we wouldn't get along with.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.37,0:18:24.45,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,But look at us now. All we're thinking about is Sadako.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.45,0:18:26.25,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Seriously!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.25,0:18:29.08,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,How much longer is she going to keep us worrying?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.08,0:18:32.09,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,We're always thinking about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.30,0:18:36.42,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,We really like her, don't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.59,0:18:42.51,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,I said that it would be difficult to\N answer whether we're friends with her or not,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.43,0:18:46.52,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,but we're definitely friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.43,0:18:51.77,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,I mean, think about it. If she wasn't our friend,\N could we worry over her as much as we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.82,0:18:58.11,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,There's no knowing how others are feeling unless you ask them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.70,0:19:02.82,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,And your feelings can't get through\N to others unless you tell them directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.91,0:19:06.66,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Because we can't understand each other, it\N makes us want to make things clear even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.25,0:19:09.21,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,And that really brings joy to my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.12,0:19:13.17,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Right now, I feel that way without a doubt in my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.04,0:19:17.42,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,And the fact I was able to meet\N people who could make me feel that way...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.05,0:19:20.34,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,...makes me so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.68,0:19:26.77,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I... wonder if Yano-san and Yoshida-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.77,0:19:29.39,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,...will talk to me when we see each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.39,0:19:34.06,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Oh, but... I'm sure they'll be studying for tests\N during free time, so maybe I'll try it after school...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.06,0:19:37.23,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,But wait! They may want to go home to study for tomorrow's tests!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.36,0:19:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HFF&}PLACEHOLDER
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.15,0:19:43.37,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Hey... is it just me, or do you hear a voice coming from that stall?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.37,0:19:44.87,Default,Girl2,0,0,0,,Oh my gosh! Quit scaring me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.36,0:19:42.20,Default-alt,Sawako,0,0,0,,"I-I'm sorry to be a bother, but..."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.49,0:19:48.29,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I'm really nervous, but I don't mind at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.66,0:19:50.79,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Don't forget, you already have someone you can talk to, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.37,0:19:53.08,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,They'll hear me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.92,0:19:57.13,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I'm sure they will.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.42,0:20:00.47,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Man, I'm so screwed for today's test!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.47,0:20:02.05,Default,Girl2,0,0,0,,Yeah, me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.05,0:20:05.22,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,O-Oh no! I got too caught up and ended up staying for too long!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.14,0:20:04.84,Default-alt,Girl,0,0,0,,Oh yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.84,0:20:07.64,Default-alt,Girl,0,0,0,,Do you remember the rumors about Sadako?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.64,0:20:10.68,Default,Girl2,0,0,0,,Yeah, the thing about having Yano and Yoshida as her backups?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.69,0:20:14.19,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Rumors?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.19,0:20:15.52,Default,Girl2,0,0,0,,Well, I heard-
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.98,0:20:18.27,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I-It's all a misunderstanding!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.12,0:20:29.54,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Yano-san and Yoshida-san aren't backing me up or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.54,0:20:31.79,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,So... umm....
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.79,0:20:33.83,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,It's all a lie, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.83,0:20:37.63,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Yano-san and Yoshida-san are really nice people!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.63,0:20:39.21,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,And here comes Sadako!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.21,0:20:40.38,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,"Really nice people"?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.38,0:20:42.05,Default,Girl2,0,0,0,,What's this girl talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.05,0:20:43.68,Default,Girl2,0,0,0,,Maybe she just wants to talk to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.88,0:20:45.93,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Don't you think she's glaring at us?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.93,0:20:48.18,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,N-No, I always look like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.18,0:20:50.89,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Umm... so Yano-san and Yoshida-
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.73,0:20:54.35,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Shut up already.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.69,0:20:56.06,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,We get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.06,0:20:57.56,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Yoshida and Yano, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.86,0:20:58.90,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Y-You get it now-
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.90,0:21:02.86,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,The criminal delinquent and the whore, right?
