Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.49,0:22:28.03,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I want to clear up these misunderstandings.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.70,0:22:30.16,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I can't give up these feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.41,0:22:33.62,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Next time: Friends.
